    {
      "id": "claim_bb46dfb2fe4042f588e5749237cf0336",
      "statement": "Deprecated model ids are not canonically replaced: DEPRECATED_MODEL_REPLACEMENTS has empty values and returns None for deprecated ids. Deprecated ids are excluded from provider_fallback_pair and defer to defaults, while unsupported non-deprecated ids may use same-provider and, where possible, same-Claude-family fallback.",
