      "id": "claim_53f2e53105084a8183ad17e58849328e",
      "statement": "Per-user profiles live in the ['profiles'] namespace holding default_model, reasoning_effort, an optional subagent pair, repository/branch and PR preferences, and model-routing/UI settings; profile-editable settings are deliberately split from the encrypted GitHub OAuth token stored in ['oauth_tokens'] so a profile save and a concurrent login/refresh cannot clobber each other's fields.",
